  "content": {
    "id": "p9-q4-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Determine which right-angled triangles have side lengths that are all consecutive integers. Hint: let $n$ be the side length of the shortest side.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p9-q4-short-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Only the triangle with side lengths 3, 4 and 5.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q4-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Use consecutive lengths ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "n,\\ n+1,\\ n+2",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " in Pythagoras and retain the positive solution.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "The side lengths are $n$, $n+1$ and $n+2$, with hypotenuse $n+2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}n^2+(n+1)^2&=(n+2)^2\\\\2n^2+2n+1&=n^2+4n+4\\\\n^2-2n-3&=0\\\\(n-3)(n+1)&=0\\\\n&=3\\text{ or }-1\\end{align*}$$\nSince $n>0$, $n=3$. The only possible side lengths are $3$, $4$ and $5$. They satisfy $3^2+4^2=5^2$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
